{"3526620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Day After Day", "steam_appid": 3526620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/b3364360b7d8360660a8a6017e9f9099.poster.avif?t=1784826953\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/b3364360b7d8360660a8a6017e9f9099.webm?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/b3364360b7d8360660a8a6017e9f9099.mp4?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vera</strong> finds herself on the docks of Vadena, an island of winding canals and opulent wealth, after a savage attack on her ship that nearly ends her life. Left with gaps in her memory, she roams the island in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed to repeat a single day, Vera must uncover who has cursed her and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How will you break the loop?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2010e67daeef97b525a470ab589ac220.avif?t=1784826953\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Protagonist, Vera:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bounty hunter by trade, Vera is no stranger to tracking down people and uncovering their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time around, after an attack on her ship that leaves her with memory loss, Vera must discover her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pirate, Balazar:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man of mystery, Balazar seems hell-bent on getting on Vera's very last nerve - and making her like it. Will you choose to stay enemies or to become lovers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nobleman, Enzo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the two children of the Duke of Vadena, Enzo is committed to his nation and to the betterment of his people. Will you try to turn his head or help his people alongside him?<br><br> <strong>The Townspeople:</strong><br><br>Each with their own personality, goals, and responses to Vera's biting personality, you must decide whether to befriend the people of Vadena or manipulate them to your advantage. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/070056ff91ce8bfd1abee388fc87d9a3.poster.avif?t=1784826953\" width=826 height=647 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/070056ff91ce8bfd1abee388fc87d9a3.webm?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/20735a239ec2349ecd4eae7166a0bf5d.avif?t=1784826953\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom skill tree with passive and active skill checks that affect the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quest system with multiple ways to complete quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous outfits and hairstyles for Vera that affect her stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large cast of diverse characters to get to know</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive map with hidden locations to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with more to come as development continues after this Kickstarter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2c55f786643b0ae89a3dc272e4e26a60.poster.avif?t=1784826953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2c55f786643b0ae89a3dc272e4e26a60.webm?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2c55f786643b0ae89a3dc272e4e26a60.mp4?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/b3364360b7d8360660a8a6017e9f9099.poster.avif?t=1784826953\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/b3364360b7d8360660a8a6017e9f9099.webm?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/b3364360b7d8360660a8a6017e9f9099.mp4?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vera</strong> finds herself on the docks of Vadena, an island of winding canals and opulent wealth, after a savage attack on her ship that nearly ends her life. Left with gaps in her memory, she roams the island in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed to repeat a single day, Vera must uncover who has cursed her and why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How will you break the loop?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2010e67daeef97b525a470ab589ac220.avif?t=1784826953\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Protagonist, Vera:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bounty hunter by trade, Vera is no stranger to tracking down people and uncovering their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time around, after an attack on her ship that leaves her with memory loss, Vera must discover her own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pirate, Balazar:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man of mystery, Balazar seems hell-bent on getting on Vera's very last nerve - and making her like it. Will you choose to stay enemies or to become lovers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Nobleman, Enzo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the two children of the Duke of Vadena, Enzo is committed to his nation and to the betterment of his people. Will you try to turn his head or help his people alongside him?<br><br> <strong>The Townspeople:</strong><br><br>Each with their own personality, goals, and responses to Vera's biting personality, you must decide whether to befriend the people of Vadena or manipulate them to your advantage. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/070056ff91ce8bfd1abee388fc87d9a3.poster.avif?t=1784826953\" width=826 height=647 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/070056ff91ce8bfd1abee388fc87d9a3.webm?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/20735a239ec2349ecd4eae7166a0bf5d.avif?t=1784826953\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom skill tree with passive and active skill checks that affect the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quest system with multiple ways to complete quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous outfits and hairstyles for Vera that affect her stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large cast of diverse characters to get to know</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive map with hidden locations to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with more to come as development continues after this Kickstarter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2c55f786643b0ae89a3dc272e4e26a60.poster.avif?t=1784826953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2c55f786643b0ae89a3dc272e4e26a60.webm?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/extras/2c55f786643b0ae89a3dc272e4e26a60.mp4?t=1784826953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Making mayhem, claiming valuables, and breaking hearts may be a full day's work, but the day keeps repeating and you have no idea why. Build your skillset, break your curse, and befriend or betray townspeople in this otome narrative RPG.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/0a9c97f775eadd4fc79069b8a9ce41b98b26cf54/header.jpg?t=1784826953", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/0e24ee58503a49da23c2352205cada52da5062fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784826953", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526620/0e24ee58503a49da23c2352205cada5